      "heading": "Official sources",
      "html": "<p>The law and guidance this page relies on. Official sources checked on 18 November 2026.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2005/735/regulation/12\" rel=\"noopener\">Work at Height Regulations 2005, regulation 12: inspection of work equipment</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2005/735/schedule/7\" rel=\"noopener\">Work at Height Regulations 2005, Schedule 7: particulars to be included in a report of inspection</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2015/51/regulation/13\" rel=\"noopener\">CDM 2015, regulation 13: duties of a principal contractor</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2015/51/regulation/12\" rel=\"noopener\">CDM 2015, regulation 12: construction phase plan and health and safety file</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2015/51/regulation/6\" rel=\"noopener\">CDM 2015, regulation 6: notification of a project</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/1974/37/section/22\" rel=\"noopener\">Health and Safety at Work etc. Act 1974, section 22: prohibition notices</a></li></ul>"
